                "差分",
                "背包"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "https://xsc062.netlify.app/20240131/",
            "url": "https://xsc062.netlify.app/20240131/",
            "title": "解题报告：USACO2024JAN",
            "date_published": "2024-01-31T02:30:29.000Z",
            "content_html": "<p>假的，只连打了两组。Ag 没时间了。日后再补吧。</p>\r\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\r\n<p><img\r\nsrc=\"https://pic.imgdb.cn/item/65b7b152871b83018ac5e7b7.gif\" /></p>\r\n<p>无意中存了题面，但代码大部分因为系统还原消失了，只有文字题解，将就着看吧。</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3 id=\"cu-a.-majority-opinion\">Cu A. Majority Opinion</h3>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10131\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10131</a></p>\r\n<p><em>省流：任意区间内，若某元素出现个数严格大于区间长度一半，则可将整个区间推平为该值。问最终可以使整个序列被推平为哪些值。</em></p>\r\n<p>注意到当任意长度 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\ge 2\\)</span>\r\n的区间可以被推平为某种元素时，整个数列都可以被推平为该元素。故目标转化为对于某种元素判定是否存在一个可被其推平的区间。</p>\r\n<p>统计元素个数采用前缀和。令 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(s_i\\)</span>\r\n表示 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(h_i\\)</span> 在前 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(i\\)</span> 项中出现的次数，假设有 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\([j,i]\\)</span> 满足条件，贪心可知 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(h_i=h_j\\)</span>。</p>\r\n<p>那么由定义有 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(i-j+1&lt;2\\times\r\n(s_i-s_j+1)\\)</span>。典中典，直接移项分离变量。则有 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(i-2\\times s_i-1&lt;j-2\\times s_j\\)</span>。令\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(t_p\\gets p-2\\times s_p\\)</span>，对于每个\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(h\\)</span> 记录 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(t_j\\)</span> 最大值查看是否有 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(i,j\\)</span> 满足条件即可。</p>\r\n<h3 id=\"cu-b.-cannonball\">Cu B. Cannonball</h3>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10132\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10132</a></p>\r\n<p><em>省流：有 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(N\\)</span> 个格子，从 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(s\\)</span> 格子开始以 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(1\\)</span>\r\n为初始能量向右跳，跳一步的距离为能量大小。格子分两种，一种经过加一定能量并反向，另一种若当前能量大于一定值则可永久摧毁，问跳出范围或无限长时间后可摧毁格子个数。</em></p>\r\n<p>不难发现若忽略增加能量为 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(0\\)</span>\r\n的跳板则每经过一个跳板可跳距离增加 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(1\\)</span>，最多增加到 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(n\\)</span>，否则会跳出去。</p>\r\n<p>注意到调和级数，故直接模拟跳的过程。唯一导致时间无限的情况是存在相邻的增加能量为\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(0\\)</span>\r\n的跳板，但其实它具体是什么并不重要，反正我们跳的次数严格大于调和级数后就可以认为进入死循环，直接结束模拟即可。我这里嫌麻烦直接拿了\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(2\\times 10^8\\)</span> 作阈值。</p>\r\n<h3 id=\"cu-c.-balancing-bacteria\">Cu C. Balancing Bacteria</h3>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10133\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10133</a></p>\r\n<p><em>省流：定义一次操作为选取一个整数 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(\\Delta\\le N\\)</span>，并从 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(N\\)</span> 到 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(1\\)</span>，令 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(a_i\\gets a_i+\\Delta\\)</span> 并令 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 向 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(0\\)</span> 靠近 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(1\\)</span>，<span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(\\Delta=0\\)</span> 时停止。问令所有 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(a_i=0\\)</span> 所需最少操作次数。</em></p>\r\n<p>挺有意思的思维题，首先需要进行一个思维转化。<span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(\\Delta\\le N\\)</span>\r\n是一个利于解题的限制，这意味着我们想让任何一个 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(a_i\\)</span> 改变 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(1\\)</span> 而不影响到之前的值，从让 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(a_1\\gets 0\\)</span> 入手，进行一次操作后每个 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(a_i\\)</span> 分到的 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 应依次加 1 或依次减\r\n1。则差分数组为 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(0\\)</span> 后跟着一截 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(1\\)</span>\r\n是理想状态。中间每有一项不满足规律都会带来额外的操作次数。</p>\r\n<p>归纳为差分数组的差分数组绝对值之和即为答案。</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3 id=\"ag-a.-cowmpetency\">Ag A. Cowmpetency</h3>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10134\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10134</a></p>\r\n<p><em>省流：有若干条限制，每条形如 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(\\max\\limits_{i=1}^{a_h-1}\\{A_i\\}=\\max\\limits_{i=1}^{a_j}\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>\r\n且 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(A_{a_h}&gt;\\max\\limits_{i=1}^{a_h-1}\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>，部分数已知，构造出符合条件且字典序最小的序列。</em></p>\r\n<p>是本场最难题吧，但也没啥卡的。画个线段图容易发现，若将 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\([a,h)\\)</span> 视作一条线段，那么除非 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(h\\)</span>\r\n相同，否则两条线段不能有交集。不然的话就无解。以及如果存在不满足条件的定值也显然无解。</p>\r\n<p>从前往后看每个 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(h\\)</span>\r\n并尝试赋值，对于每个 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(1\\sim a\\)</span>\r\n记录一个需要满足的最大值数值，按照此数值从后往前填空格。</p>\r\n<p>填完过后扫一遍看看是不是全部合法，可以证明若此时不合法则无解。</p>\r\n<h3 id=\"ag-b.-potion-farming\">Ag B. Potion Farming</h3>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10135\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10135</a></p>\r\n<p><em>省流：一棵树，每个点上有若干个物品，对于每条从根到叶子的简单路径，可以选择路径上的一个物品，每个物品只能被选一次，问最多可选物品数。</em></p>\r\n<p>如果一个点引导的子树下所有叶子有没有分配到的，就可以把这个点的物品分配给该叶子。</p>\r\n<p>跑一个树形 DP 即可。</p>\r\n<details>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb1\"><pre\r\nclass=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb1-1\"><a href=\"#cb1-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"kw\">namespace</span> XSC062 <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-2\"><a href=\"#cb1-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"kw\">using</span> <span class=\"kw\">namespace</span> fastIO<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-3\"><a href=\"#cb1-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"at\">const</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> maxn <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"fl\">1e5</span> <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">5</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-4\"><a href=\"#cb1-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> n<span class=\"op\">,</span> x<span class=\"op\">,</span> y<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-5\"><a href=\"#cb1-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> cnt<span class=\"op\">[</span>maxn<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-6\"><a href=\"#cb1-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"bu\">std::</span>vector<span class=\"op\">&lt;</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span><span class=\"op\">&gt;</span> g<span class=\"op\">[</span>maxn<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-7\"><a href=\"#cb1-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> a<span class=\"op\">[</span>maxn<span class=\"op\">],</span> f<span class=\"op\">[</span>maxn<span class=\"op\">],</span> p<span class=\"op\">[</span>maxn<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-8\"><a href=\"#cb1-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> min<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> x<span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> y<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-9\"><a href=\"#cb1-9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">return</span> x <span class=\"op\">&lt;</span> y <span class=\"op\">?</span> x <span class=\"op\">:</span> y<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-10\"><a href=\"#cb1-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-11\"><a href=\"#cb1-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">void</span> DFS<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> x<span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> fa<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-12\"><a href=\"#cb1-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">if</span> <span class=\"op\">((</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span><span class=\"op\">)</span>g<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">].</span>size<span class=\"op\">()</span> <span class=\"op\">==</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-13\"><a href=\"#cb1-13\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        cnt<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-14\"><a href=\"#cb1-14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"kw\">auto</span> i <span class=\"op\">:</span> g<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">])</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-15\"><a href=\"#cb1-15\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">if</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span>i <span class=\"op\">==</span> fa<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"cf\">continue</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-16\"><a href=\"#cb1-16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        DFS<span class=\"op\">(</span>i<span class=\"op\">,</span> x<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-17\"><a href=\"#cb1-17\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        f<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">+=</span> f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-18\"><a href=\"#cb1-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        cnt<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">+=</span> cnt<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-19\"><a href=\"#cb1-19\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-20\"><a href=\"#cb1-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">if</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">&lt;</span> cnt<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">])</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-21\"><a href=\"#cb1-21\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        f<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> min<span class=\"op\">(</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">+</span> a<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">],</span> cnt<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-22\"><a href=\"#cb1-22\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">return</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-23\"><a href=\"#cb1-23\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-24\"><a href=\"#cb1-24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">void</span> add<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> x<span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> y<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-25\"><a href=\"#cb1-25\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    g<span class=\"op\">[</span>x<span class=\"op\">].</span>push_back<span class=\"op\">(</span>y<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-26\"><a href=\"#cb1-26\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">return</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-27\"><a href=\"#cb1-27\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-28\"><a href=\"#cb1-28\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> main<span class=\"op\">()</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-29\"><a href=\"#cb1-29\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    read<span class=\"op\">(</span>n<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-30\"><a href=\"#cb1-30\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span> read<span class=\"op\">(</span>p<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-31\"><a href=\"#cb1-31\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-32\"><a href=\"#cb1-32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        read<span class=\"op\">(</span>x<span class=\"op\">),</span> read<span class=\"op\">(</span>y<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-33\"><a href=\"#cb1-33\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        add<span class=\"op\">(</span>x<span class=\"op\">,</span> y<span class=\"op\">),</span> add<span class=\"op\">(</span>y<span class=\"op\">,</span> x<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-34\"><a href=\"#cb1-34\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-35\"><a href=\"#cb1-35\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"dt\">int</span> tot <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-36\"><a href=\"#cb1-36\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">2</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-37\"><a href=\"#cb1-37\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        tot <span class=\"op\">+=</span> <span class=\"op\">((</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span><span class=\"op\">)</span>g<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">].</span>size<span class=\"op\">()</span> <span class=\"op\">==</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-38\"><a href=\"#cb1-38\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> tot<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>p<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-39\"><a href=\"#cb1-39\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    DFS<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"op\">-</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-40\"><a href=\"#cb1-40\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    print<span class=\"op\">(</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">],</span> <span class=\"ch\">&#39;</span><span class=\"sc\">\\n</span><span class=\"ch\">&#39;</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-41\"><a href=\"#cb1-41\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">return</span> <span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-42\"><a href=\"#cb1-42\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-43\"><a href=\"#cb1-43\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">&#125;</span> <span class=\"co\">// namespace XSC062</span></span></code></pre></div>\r\n</details>\r\n<h3 id=\"ag-c.-cowlendar\">Ag C. Cowlendar</h3>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10136\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10136</a></p>\r\n<p><em>省流：对于给定的序列 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span>，找出所有满足 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(a_i\\bmod L\\)</span> 的值的种类最多为 3 的 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(L\\)</span>。</em></p>\r\n<p>也是挺有意思的数学题了。若将 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(a_i\\)</span>\r\n按照模 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(L\\)</span> 的情况分组，则对于任意一个\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(a_i\\)</span>，在 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\((a_i,a_i+L)\\)</span>\r\n中最多包含两个分别来自其余两组的数。</p>\r\n<p>对于去重后 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(n&gt;3\\)</span>\r\n的情况，由鸽巢得必定有两个数可分为一组。故我们枚举可能的组间间隔，而可能的\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(L\\)</span> 就是这些间隔的因数。</p>\r\n<p>由上面我们推出一个合法组间间隔中最多间隔三个数，我们将所有 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(a_{i+3}-a_i\\)</span>、<span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(a_{i+2}-a_i\\)</span> 和 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(a_{i+1}-a_i\\)</span>\r\n纳入考虑范围即可。对于所有可能的 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(L\\)</span>，直接 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(O(n)\\)</span> 跑一个 <code>check</code>\r\n检查是否合法。</p>\r\n<p>因子个数照理来说是 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\sqrt{V}\\times\r\nn\\)</span> 级别的，但是实测 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(n\\)</span>\r\n最多只有一百多。估计是因为 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(n\\)</span>\r\n太大就很难构造出更多的合法解吧。</p>\r\n<details>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb2\"><pre\r\nclass=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb2-1\"><a href=\"#cb2-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define int </span><span class=\"dt\">long</span><span class=\"pp\"> </span><span class=\"dt\">long</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-2\"><a href=\"#cb2-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"kw\">namespace</span> XSC062 <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-3\"><a href=\"#cb2-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"kw\">using</span> <span class=\"kw\">namespace</span> fastIO<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-4\"><a href=\"#cb2-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"at\">const</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> maxn <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"fl\">1e4</span> <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">5